    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Launching this September, The Owell is a stunning new 4-bedroom house type, with only a limited number of homes available.\r\n\r\nSpanning an impressive 177 sq m / 1,910 sq ft across three floors, this beautifully designed 4-bedroom, 4-bathroom home combines contemporary style, generous living spaces and exceptional energy efficiency — perfectly suited to the demands of modern family life.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of The Owell house type is a bright, open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, designed for both everyday family life and entertaining. The high-quality, fully fitted kitchen features elegant cabinetry and sophisticated countertops.\r\n\r\nA separate utility room provides valuable additional storage and practical convenience, helping to keep the main living spaces beautifully organised.\r\n\r\nWith its thoughtful design, impressive proportions and energy-efficient features, The Owell offers a stylish and comfortable home built for the way families live today.\r\n\r\nThese newly built homes in Mullingar, crafted by Ballymore, combine modern energy efficiency with quality design. Set within a thoughtfully planned residential development, these homes offer a high standard of finish and exceptional attention to detail, as expected from Ballymore.\r\n\r\nFor more information visit www.ballinderrygardens.com"
      },
